{"id":"n15669-2-4","stage":2,"title":"사정 · 恳求","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15669-2-4-1","ko":"어휴, 갑자기 주인집에서 집세를 올려 달래.","zh":"唉，房东突然要涨房租了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어휴,","meaning":"啊呀","explanation":"어휴：啊呀","readings":[{"term":"어휴","audio":"/audio/33db5a7c17e3ccd6f13a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67148","senseId":"1","lemma":"어휴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어휴","audio":"/audio/33db5a7c17e3ccd6f13a.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"주인집에서","meaning":"房东，房东家","explanation":"주인집：房东，房东家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"주인집","audio":"/audio/e89115a7abf1b526cc70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76999","senseId":"1","lemma":"주인집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주인집에서","audio":"/audio/4bba6e0a23c360a4ca24.mp3"}},{"text":"집세를","meaning":"房租","explanation":"집세：房租；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집세","audio":"/audio/d4d231cab576236f3406.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80035","senseId":"1","lemma":"집세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집세를","audio":"/audio/d0f931378582a33a8e9a.mp3"}},{"text":"올려","meaning":"提高","explanation":"올리다：提高；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"2","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올려","audio":"/audio/7451fed596c0e318c0ce.mp3"}},{"text":"달래.","meaning":"请求，要","explanation":"달다：请求，要；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62360","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","orig